  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large skillet over medium heat.",
    "Add the onion and garlic and cook until softened, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the broccoli, caraway seeds, and salt. Cook, stirring occasionally, until the broccoli is tender, about 10 minutes.",
    "Add the canned tomatoes, white beans, and lemon juice. Stir to combine.",
    "Reduce heat to low and simmer, covered, for 10 minutes.",
    "Stir in the chopped parsley. Serve immediately.",
    "Transfer the fasulye to a wooden board for serving."
  ],
